 "query": "I stopped by the corner food cart on my walk over here, right? The guy running it was grilling up these garlic butter corn cobs that smelled so good I ended up grabbing one even though I already ate lunch an hour ago, and I swear it was the best thing I\u2019ve tasted all week\u2014he dusted it with this chili lime seasoning that had just enough kick to make my nose run a little, but not so much that I couldn\u2019t finish the whole thing standing there on the sidewalk while a group of tiny dogs in matching sweaters trotted past with their dog walker. I\u2019m browsing the iPhone accessories section right now, and I\u2019ve heard wireless charging options are available in this product line. I\u2019ve heard those options come in that one color I always pick, and that other color variants don\u2019t align with what I\u2019ve consistently leaned toward in past purchases. I\u2019ve heard there are accessible price points across the selection too, and that super pricey options exist that don\u2019t line up with what I\u2019m working with budget-wise, since I\u2019m not made of money.",
